# Build context for packaging/docker/Dockerfile: the workspace manifests and the source of the
# crates `cargo build -p gridcraft-cli` links, the built web site the image serves (dist/web), and
# the nginx config it copies in. Everything else is left out to keep the upload small.
.git
.github
target
target-*
docs
contributors
plan
ROADMAP.md
craft-fonts
corpus
log
# Keep dist/web — the site the image serves — and drop the release artifacts.
dist/release
# Keep packaging/docker — the Dockerfile and the nginx config — and drop the installer trees.
packaging/freebsd
packaging/linux
packaging/macos
packaging/web
packaging/windows
